    {
      "bbox": [
        207,
        744,
        991,
        832
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It is absolutely essential that the lines of communication with our Albany office be kept open -- particularly since we are now in the latter part of the legislative session when so many crucial decisions are made.",
