    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        207,
        851,
        1008,
        983
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Accordingly, please hand deliver all comments on legislation and other material to the New York office of the Legislative Representative -- Room 110, 52 Chambers Street -- before 4 p.m. each day and, at the same time, have your messenger pick up all material from the Albany office to your agency or department.",
